<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-sanguozhi" book-id="b-sanguozhi-051" chapter-id="c-sanguozhi-051-appraisal" source-id="s-sanguozhi-051-appraisal">
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-051-appraisal:line059" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">　　評曰：夫親親恩義，古今之常。宗子維城，詩人所稱。況此諸孫，或贊興初基，或鎮據邊陲，克堪厥任，不忝其榮者乎!故詳著雲。</p>
</text>
